---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import HubSpotForm from '../components/HubSpotForm.astro';
---
<Base title="Book a migration assessment" description="Book a free AI-assisted assessment and sizing of your integration estate.">
  <section class="section on-dark">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Free migration assessment</p>
      <h1>Know exactly what you're moving before you commit to anything.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Our AI-assisted assessment and sizing takes about a week and is free of charge. It's the first step in every 345 Technology migration.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid grid-2">
      <div>
        <h2>What you get</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>A report on your integration estate, the Azure services it should move to, and indicative estimates</li>
          <li>A costed migration backlog you can plan and budget against</li>
          <li>The full underlying data, including a complete inventory of your platform, for you to keep</li>
          <li>A playback session to walk your team through the findings</li>
          <li>Clear next steps, with no obligation</li>
        </ul>
        <h2 style="margin-top:40px">How it works</h2>
        <p>We start with a short conversation about your platform and goals. Then we run our AI-assisted analysis and walk you through the findings.</p>
        <h2 style="margin-top:40px">What we need from you</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>An export of your integration applications</li>
          <li>Access to run our analysis tools, agreed with you before we start</li>
          <li>Time with the people who know your platform</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Request your assessment</h2>
        <HubSpotForm form="assessment" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="narrow">
        <h2>Choose the right starting point</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:32px">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Migration assessment</p>
          <p class="stat">Free</p>
          <p><strong>About one week.</strong> Everything listed above: the report, the costed backlog, the full data and a playback session.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Assessment + proof of value</p>
          <p class="stat">£10,000 <span style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600">+ VAT</span></p>
          <p>The full assessment, plus a proof of value on your own platform, so you can see the approach working before you commit to a full migration.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Your data and AI</h2>
      <p>We analyse the configuration you export using GitHub Copilot Enterprise, under 345 Technology's own licence.</p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Your configuration is used only for your assessment.</li>
        <li>Under our licence, GitHub does not use your data to train AI models.</li>
        <li>We look at how your platform is built, not at the business data flowing through it.</li>
        <li>We ask you to remove passwords, keys and other secrets before you share anything.</li>
        <li>We agree with you in advance what we receive, where it is stored and when it is deleted.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
